    {
      "title": "Agreed illustration scope",
      "text": "Children's book illustration order\nSeller: Meera, illustrator based in India\nBuyer: Riku, independent author\nBook: The Little Cloud's Garden\nAgreed price: JPY 48,000\n\nRequirements:\n1. Deliver six full-color interior illustrations as print-ready PNG files.\n2. Deliver one full-color front cover illustration as a print-ready PNG file.\n3. Deliver character sheets for both Momo the cloud and Pip the sparrow.\n4. Deliver a black-and-white coloring page featuring Momo and Pip.\n\nThe illustrations are for the buyer's children's book. Print-ready files should be 300 dpi. The agreed price covers the listed work; any additional artwork will need a separate quote."
    },
    {
      "title": "Digital handover note",
      "text": "From: Meera\nTo: Riku\nSubject: The Little Cloud's Garden artwork handover\n\nNamaste Riku, final files are ready. Yeh handover list hai:\n- interior-01.png through interior-06.png: six full-color interior illustrations, 300 dpi.\n- front-cover.png: full-color front cover illustration, 300 dpi.\n- momo-character-sheet.pdf: Momo's character sheet.\n\nPip's character sheet is not included. The black-and-white coloring page is also not included. I have handed over the files listed above through our shared folder; please check the artwork and let me know if any of those files won't open. The folder contains no other final artwork files."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat after delivery",
      "text": "Riku, 10:12: Hi Meera, files mil gaye. The six interior PNGs and the front cover open properly, thank you.\nMeera, 10:16: Great, shukriya for checking. Did Momo's character sheet open too?\nRiku, 10:20: Yes, Momo's sheet opens. But Pip's sheet and the coloring page are missing from the folder.\nMeera, 10:25: Haan, you're right. I haven't delivered either of those yet. Sorry, I should have finished the full agreed set before handover.\nRiku, 10:29: Please send both when ready. The illustrations received so far look good.\nMeera, 10:32: Will do. I'll message you before adding the remaining files."
    }
  ],
